        <mxCell id="M34QYPWpvPmWbHNuottj-48" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;Verification:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1.) Verify permissions using ls -l and ls -ld and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;confirm owner/group/other bits are as per request.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.) Confirm access by testing with a non-privileged user (read/write/execute as applicable).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3.) If ACLs used, validate with aclget and confirm&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;ls -el shows &quot;+&quot; for extended ACL.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
